  "description": "Hipness Purgatory is a loose aesthetic movement spanning from 2004 to 2013, associated with the Hipster movement, peaking in popularity around the very late 2000s to early 2010s. It is characterized by loose drawings, feeling handcrafted with everyday objects, an ironic tone, and a \"twee\" retro/ indie atmosphere. The style has been associated with \"millennial optimism\".",
